  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to support OSESGY Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute funds to support OSESGY&#x2019;s general programmed activities for 2025 and 2026
The work will include: 
&#x2022; High-Level Diplomacy &amp; Mediation: Engaging in negotiations, consultations, and 
shuttle diplomacy to broker de-escalation and key agreements.
&#x2022; Strategic Support for the Peace Process: Providing technical and logistical 
assistance to help the parties resume dialogue, implement key agreements, and de-escalate tensions at local, national, and regional levels.</narrative>
  </description>
